    "Galia whittled a hook from a thorn, baited it, and pulled a fish up through a hole in the ice on a line.",
    "Galia and the others raised the camp's first windbreak.",
    "The people of Drathholt held a feast by the fire on the longest night.",
    "Gre dropped meat in the embers by mistake, and found it tender and filling: from then on the band roasted its food.",
