    "The people of Drathholt held a feast by the fire on the longest night.",
    "Galia lashed a stone head to a wooden haft and made the first axe, heavy enough for the big trees.",
    "Thead learned to follow a sounder of wild boar into the thickets and take one on the braced spear.",
    "Gre slung a hide on stakes by the fire, filled it with water and meat and dropped stones in from the fire one after another till it boiled: that evening the whole band ate a stew from it.",
    "Thead sewed the offcuts of a hide into a cap and a pair of mittens, fur turned in.",
    "Galia bent two runners of ash, lashed crossbars across them, and dragged home a whole felled tree on it in one trip.",
    "Galia wove reeds into a funnel the fish swim into and cannot find their way out of.",
    "Dryjia brought down the band's first wild boar at Drathholt.",
    "Galia cut soles from a hide and gathered them at the ankle with a thong: shoes, and the long walks were easier.",
    "Galia laced a deer hide taut in a square of poles and scraped it standing, thin and even from edge to edge.",
    "Keul and the others raised the camp's first hide frame.",
    "Shunyor laid a deer out on its hide at the stores and took it apart joint by joint: the marrow cracked from the bones, the fat cut away for the lamps and the rack, and the sinew drawn from its back and dried to sew with.",
    "Galia ground a sliver of deer bone to a point, burned an eye through it, and sewed a seam in half the time.",
    "Gre brewed willow bark and bitter leaves for a fever, and the fever broke: the band had its first healer.",
    "Gre wove grass round a ring of withies into a deep basket, and came home with the berries of a dozen bushes.",
    "Gre dug up the fat roots under the reeds and the meadow grass with a sharpened stick, and found they kept all winter.",
    "Grymia, 28, died in an accident.",
    "The people of Drathholt held a feast by the fire on the longest night.",
    "Gre took an ember to a hive in a hollow tree, smoked the bees drowsy and came away with the comb.",
    "Keul noticed roots sprouting where the scraps were thrown the spring before, and dug a plot by the camp to set them in on purpose: the band's first garden.",
    "In a summer storm, lightning split a great tree by Drathholt.",
    "Pylia took it for a sign: not long after lightning striking a tree, a birth at Drathholt.",
    "Galia lined a basket with clay, left it in the embers, and found a hard pot where the basket had burned away.",
